      <title>AI驱动赛博蟑螂实现93%危险环境识别并自主逃离</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260903/AI%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8%E8%B5%9B%E5%8D%9A%E8%9F%91%E8%9E%82%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B093%E5%8D%B1%E9%99%A9%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E8%AF%86%E5%88%AB%E5%B9%B6%E8%87%AA%E4%B8%BB%E9%80%83%E7%A6%BB/</link>
